Only now, looking at this trembling man, you felt a wild hunger, like it was burning you from within. Slowly, looking at the mugger, you began to approach him. The guy's nerves wavered, he dropped his knife and the stolen bag, and he ran screaming loudly. But you were faster. By a single quick bound, you jumped up to him and bit into his throat. Your prey's scream died on his lips and you began the horrible feast…